{"availability":"available","full":"poojithdevan4D/InferPilot","name":"InferPilot","description":"Evidence-first vLLM screening and controlled capacity analysis. Screen live metrics, verify config changes, and abstain when evidence is weak.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","stars":3,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-19T08:07:55Z","updated":"2026-10-02T15:29:10Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"https://poojithdevan4d.github.io/InferPilot/","topics":["benchmarking","fp8","gpu","inference-optimization","kv-cache","llm-inference","llmops","mlops","prometheus","python-cli","quantization","vllm"],"demo":"https://poojithdevan4d.github.io/InferPilot/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T05:15:44.506Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T05:15:44.506Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T05:15:44.506Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T10:45:07.783Z","discoveredVia":[],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T10:45:07.783Z","stars":3,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-04T11:31:38.376Z","stars":3,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-06T16:31:34.137Z","stars":3,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T20:09:14.078Z","stars":3,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-11T07:24:26.583Z","stars":3,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-17T05:15:44.506Z","stars":3,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["The vLLM doctor — know if a config change will actually help, before you touch production.","Your vLLM server's GPU sits at 100% whether it's doing real work or thrashing on KV cache and recomputing preempted tokens — on a dashboard they look identical. So fp8, bigger batches, every knob gets flipped on vibes. InferPilot reads your live /metrics and tells you which regime you're actually in — and whether a lever like fp8 KV cache is worth testing, or a waste of time. No GPU needed to screen. Open source, MIT, no telemetry."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/poojithdevan4D/InferPilot/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"7a26027340d88e824484a2c21e0